#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<htonl>()  function converts the unsigned integer I<hostlong> from host "
"byte order to network byte order."
msgstr ""
"La función B<htonl>() convierte el entero largo sin signo I<hostlong> desde "
"el orden de bytes del host al de la red."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<htons>()  function converts the unsigned short integer I<hostshort> "
"from host byte order to network byte order."
msgstr ""
"La función B<htons>() convierte el entero corto sin signo I<hostshort> desde "
"el orden de bytes del host al de la red."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<ntohl>()  function converts the unsigned integer I<netlong> from "
"network byte order to host byte order."
msgstr ""
"La función B<ntohl>() convierte el entero largo sin signo I<netlong> desde "
"el orden de bytes de la red al del host."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<ntohs>()  function converts the unsigned short integer I<netshort> "
"from network byte order to host byte order."
msgstr ""
"La función B<ntohs>() convierte el entero corto sin signo I<netshort> desde "
"el orden de bytes de la red al del host."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"On the i386 the host byte order is Least Significant Byte first, whereas the "
"network byte order, as used on the Internet, is Most Significant Byte first."
msgstr ""
"En los i386 en el orden de bytes del host está primero el byte menos "
"significativo (LSB), mientras que el orden de bytes de la red, tal como se "
"usa en Internet, tiene primero el byte más significativo (MSB)."

